          "short": "$Z=\\{s,c,i,e,n\\}$",
          "worked": "The letters are $s,c,i,e,n,c,e$. Sets have no repeated elements, so list $c$ and $e$ only once:\n\n$Z=\\{s,c,i,e,n\\}$.",
